 * No change.
v20->v21:
 * No change.
v19->v20:
 * Updated resume() with scoped PM runtime call.
v18->v19:
 * Updated suspend/resume with scoped runtime calls in suspend.
v17->v18:
 * No change.
v1->v17:
 * No change.
---
